# each with the FULL set of measures the kit can track for it (filtered by
# what is registered on this install, so a girth measure appears the day it
# is registered and never before). A strand takes every measure its type
# lists when the strand needs them: a body shape is fat AND muscle. A
# practice strand states how it is checked: the practice, plus a check number
# when the kit can read one (a unilateral / zero-load share the pack
# computes, a rep max from the user's own logs). `words` recognise the type
# in the user's words; axis-add enforces the one rule the live run broke (a
# shape strand missing a shape measure is refused).
